=== MFCC on the ood validation split, up to 2000 clips
Every column has its own scale -- dB is ~4.34x natural log by base alone, and each
gamma is a different power of the same numbers. Read each column DOWN, never across.
What carries information is the ORDER of the arms within a column, and how that order
changes as the metric's compression moves from g1 (linear) toward as_logged (log).
g0.3 is Stevens' law and is the rung to quote.

